  "description": "Advanced logging and observability library with Serilog and OpenTelemetry\n      integration.\n      Provides enterprise-grade logging, distributed tracing, and metrics with support for multiple\n      sinks (console, file, database, Elasticsearch), structured logging, custom enrichers, and\n      cloud-native observability patterns. Features OpenTelemetry support for Jaeger,\n      Dynatrace, Prometheus, OTLP protocol, official ELK stack integration with\n      Elastic.Serilog.Sinks,\n      ECS compliance, auto-detection of service metadata, and high-performance observability for\n      .NET applications.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "Acontplus.Logging",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-08-02T04:11:46.417Z",
